    "description": "Gateway Distriparks invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Supply Chain Manager at our Madurai location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Gateway Distriparks:\nGateway Distriparks is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Track shipments in real-time and resolve delivery exceptions\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Coordinate with warehousing teams for inbound and outbound operations\n• Prepare MIS reports on delivery performance and SLA adherence\n• Manage reverse logistics and return merchandise authorization\n• Coordinate with customer service teams to resolve delivery issues\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Customs Clearance\n• Proficiency in Last Mile Delivery\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Reverse Logistics\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in 3PL Management\n• Proficiency in Vendor Management\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Madurai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Gateway Distriparks!",
